INSERT INTO `certificates_templete` VALUES
(1,'EXPRIENCES CERTIFICATE',2,'','','','<br><div><div style=\"color: rgb(213, 211, 211); text-align: center; line-height: 1.4;\"><font face=\"Arial\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><br></span></font></div><div style=\"color: rgb(213, 211, 211); text-align: center; line-height: 1.4;\"><br></div><div style=\"color: rgb(213, 211, 211); text-align: center; line-height: 1.4;\"><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><font face=\"Arial\"><br></font></div><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><b><font face=\"Arial\">EXPERIENCE CERTIFICATE</font></b></span></div><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><b><font face=\"Arial\"><br></font></b></span></div></div><p>This is to certify that&nbsp;<b style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 24px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">{name}</span></b>&nbsp;(User ID:<span style=\"font-family: Arial; text-align: center;\">{staff_id}</span>) has worked with&nbsp;<b style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 24px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">{institute_name}</span></b><span style=\"color: rgb(213, 211, 211); font-family: Arial; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</span>&nbsp;as&nbsp;<b>{designation}</b>&nbsp;of the&nbsp;&nbsp;<b>{department}</b>&nbsp;department from&nbsp;&nbsp;<b>{joining_date}</b>&nbsp;to&nbsp;<b>&nbsp;{today}</b>&nbsp;.</p><p><br></p><p>During this period, they performed their duties sincerely and diligently, demonstrating professionalism, teamwork, and good conduct. They made significant contributions and consistently upheld the company’s standards.</p><p><br></p><p>We wish&nbsp;<b style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 24px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">{name}</span></b>&nbsp;success in [his/her] future career.</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p>For ______</p><p>{signature}<br></p><p>&nbsp;______<br>&nbsp;______<br>&nbsp;______</p><p>Date:&nbsp;{print_date}</p></div>','',1,0,'','80','80','80','80','name',NULL,'2026-01-28 12:41:50');
